APPLE-TOUCH-ICON.PNG PLACEHOLDER

This file should be replaced with an actual PNG file.

Specifications:
- Size: 180x180px (iOS standard)
- Format: PNG with transparency
- Design: Norse mythology symbol (Mjölnir, Valknut, or Yggdrasil)
- Background: Can be transparent or solid color
- Colors: Match app theme - gold (#D4AF37), deep purple (#1a1a2e)
- Corner radius: iOS applies this automatically, design with square corners
- Safe area: Keep important elements 10px from edges

Design details:
- Center the symbol with padding
- High contrast for visibility on both light and dark iOS home screens
- Consider adding subtle gradient or glow effect
- Test on actual iOS device to verify appearance

This icon appears when users add the app to their iPhone/iPad home screen.
